Israeli attacks in south Lebanon continue, several injured 






                  Israeli attacks on southern Lebanon remain ongoing, with one military drone targeting a gathering of people, leaving several wounded.&nbsp; 

 Meanwhile, large explosions were reported in the towns of&nbsp;Haddatha and Beit Yahoun. Reports on the casualties or damage caused to the areas have not been released.&nbsp;

Drone targets power station in Libya’s Zawiya, sparks fire 






                  A drone that targeted a power station in Libya’s western city of Zawiya early on Wednesday ignited a fire at the facility, according to local media reports.&nbsp; 

 No official statement has been released regarding possible casualties or the extent of damage. Furthermore, no group has claimed&nbsp;responsibility for the attack.&nbsp;

